1
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:05,551
MAN: Good morning, Kenton Festival box office.

2
00:00:05,551 --> 00:00:07,038
How can I help you?

3
00:00:07,038 --> 00:00:08,881
WOMAN: Oh, good morning.

4
00:00:08,881 --> 00:00:16,626
I'm coming to Kenton for a few days' holiday next month, and a friend told me there's a festival.

5
00:00:16,626 --> 00:00:19,414
She gave me this number to find out about it.

6
00:00:19,414 --> 00:00:26,589
(QExample) MAN: That's right, the festival begins on the 16th of May and goes on till the 19th.

7
00:00:26,589 --> 00:00:28,763
WOMAN: Oh, that's great.

8
00:00:28,763 --> 00:00:32,008
I'll be there from the 15th till the 19th.

9
00:00:32,008 --> 00:00:35,360
(Q1) So could you tell me the programme, please?

10
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:41,386
[Q1定位词： town center] MAN: Well, on the first day, there's the opening ceremony, in the town centre.

11
00:00:41,386 --> 00:00:54,427
[Q1答案句： 2:45， start at. 原词] People start gathering around 2 o'clock, to get a good place to see from, and the events will start at 2.45, and finish about 5.30.

12
00:00:54,427 --> 00:00:56,148
WOMAN: OK, thanks.

13
00:00:56,148 --> 00:00:59,783
(Q2) I'll make sure I get there early to get a good spot.

14
00:00:59,783 --> 00:01:04,049
[Q2跟定位： 两个答案空不相邻，跟定位 mayor] MAN: The festival will be officially opened by the mayor.

15
00:01:04,049 --> 00:01:09,412
He'll just speak for a few minutes, welcoming everyone to the festival.

16
00:01:09,412 --> 00:01:15,076
All the town councillors will be there, and of course lots of other people.

17
00:01:15,076 --> 00:01:17,121
WOMAN: Right.

18
00:01:17,121 --> 00:01:21,153
[Q2答案句： band] MAN: Then there'll be a performance by a band.

19
00:01:21,153 --> 00:01:30,361
[Q2干扰项] Most years we have a children's choir, but this year the local army cadets offered to perform, and they're very good.

20
00:01:30,361 --> 00:01:31,570
WOMAN: Uhuh.

21
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:40,049
(Q3) [Q3答案句： play， 跟定位 will perform ... = permance of ... 词性同义替换] MAN: After that, a community group from the town will perform a play they've written themselves, just a short one.

22
00:01:40,049 --> 00:01:50,310
(Q4) [Q4答案句] It's about Helen Tungate. I don't know if you've heard of her?WOMAN: I certainly have.&nbsp; She was a scientist years ago.

23
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:52,159
MAN: That's right.

24
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:59,430
(Q5) She was born in Kenton exactly 100 years ago, so we're celebrating her centenary.

25
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:03,656
WOMAN: I'm a biologist, so I've always been interested in her.

26
00:02:03,656 --> 00:02:07,228
I didn't realise she came from Kenton.

27
00:02:07,228 --> 00:02:08,599
MAN: Yes.

28
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:16,550
[fireworks原词重现 跟定位] Well, all that will take place in the afternoon, and later, as the sun sets, there'll be a firework display.

29
00:02:16,550 --> 00:02:22,198
[Q5疑似干扰项park，但只是go to park] You should go to the park to watch, as you'll get the best view from there.

30
00:02:22,198 --> 00:02:26,756
[Q5答案句（river）：take place = situated ...,  on the opposite side 在…的对面= across] And the display takes place on the opposite side of the river.

31
00:02:26,756 --> 00:02:30,812
It's always one of the most popular events in the festival.

32
00:02:30,812 --> 00:02:33,061
WOMAN: Sounds great.

33
00:02:33,061 --> 00:02:36,342
(Q6) [小标题 other events] WOMAN: And what's happening on the other days?

34
00:02:36,342 --> 00:02:40,218
MAN: There are several events that go on the whole time.

35
00:02:40,218 --> 00:02:51,801
[Q6答案句(grandparents)：videos原词， relationships原词，  between... and 答案词= ... have with ...] For example, the students of the art college have produced a number of videos, all connected with relationships between children and their grandparents.

36
00:02:51,801 --> 00:02:54,346
WOMAN: That sounds interesting.

37
00:02:54,346 --> 00:02:58,519
(Q7) It makes a change from children and parents, doesn't it!

38
00:02:58,519 --> 00:03:00,487
MAN: Exactly.

39
00:03:00,487 --> 00:03:10,002
Because the art college is in use for classes, throughout the festival, the videos are being shown in Handsworth House.

40
00:03:10,002 --> 00:03:22,209
[Q7答案句：拼写， 注意W读法（double u)] WOMAN: How do you spell the name?&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MAN: H-A-N-D-S-W-O-R-T-H. Handsworth House.&nbsp;

41
00:03:22,209 --> 00:03:24,993
It's close to the Town Hall.

42
00:03:24,993 --> 00:03:26,566
WOMAN: Right.

43
00:03:26,566 --> 00:03:31,198
(Q8) MAN: Now let me see, what else can I tell you about?

44
00:03:31,198 --> 00:03:34,759
[Q8疑似答案词： ballet，先记下，听后续] WOMAN: Are there any displays of ballet dancing?

45
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:38,813
I'm particularly interested in that as I do it as a hobby.

46
00:03:38,813 --> 00:03:47,409
[Q8干扰项： isn't any, Q8答案句： but ... traditional✅， demonstration=performance] MAN: There isn't any ballet, I'm afraid, but there'll be a demonstration of traditional dances from all round the country.

47
00:03:47,409 --> 00:03:49,474
(Q9) WOMAN: Oh, that'd be nice.

48
00:03:49,474 --> 00:03:51,449
[where... = venue] Where's that being held?

49
00:03:51,449 --> 00:03:57,983
[Q9答案句] MAN: It's in the market in the town centre - the outdoor one, not the covered market.

50
00:03:57,983 --> 00:04:05,954
(Q10) [Q10跟定位] And it's on at 2 and 5 every afternoon of the festival, apart from the first day.

51
00:04:05,954 --> 00:04:07,626
WOMAN: Lovely.

52
00:04:07,626 --> 00:04:12,451
I'm interested in all kinds of dancing, so I'm sure I'll enjoy that!

53
00:04:12,451 --> 00:04:13,710
MAN: Mmm.

54
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:15,135
I'm sure you will.

55
00:04:15,135 --> 00:04:19,437
[Q10跟定位：concerts] WOMAN: And I'd really like to go to some concerts, if there are any.

56
00:04:19,437 --> 00:04:21,625
MAN: Yes, there are several.

57
00:04:21,625 --> 00:04:26,858
Three performed by professionals, and one by local children.

58
00:04:26,858 --> 00:04:29,607
WOMAN: And where is it being held?

59
00:04:29,607 --> 00:04:33,790
[Q10跟定位：library] MAN: It's in the library, which is in Park Street.

60
00:04:33,790 --> 00:04:38,697
On the 18th, at 6.30 in the evening.

61
00:04:38,697 --> 00:04:41,970
WOMAN: I presume I'll need tickets for that.

62
00:04:41,970 --> 00:04:43,177
MAN: Yes.

63
00:04:43,177 --> 00:04:48,312
[Q10跟定位] You can book online, or you can buy them when you arrive in Kenton.

64
00:04:48,312 --> 00:04:55,206
[Q10答案句，display ... = have ...] Either at the festival box office, or from any shops displaying our logo in the windows.

65
00:04:55,206 --> 00:04:56,879
WOMAN: Well.

66
00:04:56,879 --> 00:05:01,242
I think that'll keep me busy for the whole of my stay in Kenton.

67
00:05:01,242 --> 00:05:04,007
Thank you so much for all your help.

68
00:05:04,007 --> 00:05:05,485
MAN: You're welcome.

69
00:05:05,485 --> 00:05:08,014
I hope you enjoy your stay.

70
00:05:08,014 --> 00:05:09,072
WOMAN: Thank you.

71
00:05:09,072 --> 00:05:11,572
Goodbye.

